{
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "1882",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Ah, a fine specimen this is. I will send it to be studied by our apothecaries to determine the extent of the Plagueland's taint.\n\nWell done, <name>. For your services, I present to you this choice: an orb or staff. Whichever you choose, you will find it quite useful."
    },
    {
      "id": "1885",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "Mennet Carkad"
    },
    {
      "id": "1885",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "<Name>? Not quite what I was expecting, considering Carkad himself has taken an interest to you. Looks can be deceiving though, right?\n\nEither way, you should go see him as soon as possible. You wouldn't want to know what happened to the last few that chose to ignore his summons."
    },
    {
      "id": "1885",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Speak with Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter of the Undercity."
    },
    {
      "id": "1885",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Hm. No doubt you made your way here at first mention of my summons, yes? Of course. I would expect no less from a prospective Deathstalker."
    },
    {
      "id": "1886",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "The Deathstalkers"
    },
    {
      "id": "1886",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "If you wish to join the Deathstalkers, Lord Varimathras' elite guard, you will have to prove your worth.\n\nI will not lie to you, <Name>, this task could mean your death.\n\nI have some things that need attending to. I require the personal effects of Astor Hadren, a messenger who travels between Silverpine and the Undercity. I will leave the method of procurement to your discretion.\n\nIt will be better for you if you know less of the nature of this business. Succeed and I shall tell you more."
    },
    {
      "id": "1886",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Get Astor's Letter of Introduction and return it to Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter."
    },
    {
      "id": "1886",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Success to report?"
    },
    {
      "id": "1886",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Well done, <name>. You've passed the first part of this test. Hopefully Andron will not have caught wind of your activities, and we will be able to convince him that you are, in fact, the messenger he is expecting."
    },
    {
      "id": "1898",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "The Deathstalkers"
    },
    {
      "id": "1898",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "The letter of introduction should be enough to convince Andron that you are the messenger he's been waiting for. I've met Andron before, he doesn't quite have the mental capacity to be that suspicious.\n\nLord Varimathras suspects that Andron has been providing aid to some other group. He wishes to know what organization this is and requires proof of it.\n\nI want you to speak with Andron, and obtain this information. You'll find him at his shop near the Apothecarium."
    },
    {
      "id": "1898",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Speak with Andron Gant in the Undercity."
    },
    {
      "id": "1898",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Hello. Something I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "1898",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Ah, yes, I've been expecting you. I have no doubt our mutual acquaintances are pleased with the information that I have provided so far?\n\nI suppose there's no point in asking you, I doubt they would burden you with this knowledge. Why place so much trust in the messenger, hm?"
    },
    {
      "id": "1899",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "The Deathstalkers"
    },
    {
      "id": "1899",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "You'll find the ledger with the information your employers seek on the bookshelf behind me. Deliver it with my regards, and tell them that I would prefer it if they sent you, if they find enough value that they should wish to continue our arrangement."
    },
    {
      "id": "1899",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Bring Andron's Ledger to Mennet Carkad in the Rogues' Quarter of Undercity."
    },
    {
      "id": "1899",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Success, <name>?"
    },
    {
      "id": "1899",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Well, this is certainly more information than I suspected to get out of Andron. Give me a moment to peruse it, before I set you to your next task."
    },
    {
      "id": "1978",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "The Deathstalkers"
    },
    {
      "id": "1978",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "The Syndicate? I would never have suspected. It seems the lords of Alterac have fallen far in the years since their betrayal.\n\nLord Varimathras will be pleased to learn of this, and as you were so instrumental in this discovery, it would be fitting if you were the one to deliver it to him.\n\nAh, and how could I forget?\n\nWelcome to the Deathstalkers."
    },
    {
      "id": "1978",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Deliver Andron's Ledger to Varimathras in the Hall of the Dark Lady in the Undercity."
    },
    {
      "id": "1978",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Yes?"
    },
    {
      "id": "1978",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "Hmm, this is interesting. The Deathstalkers have performed their duties admirably in ferreting this out.\n\nFrom what I understand, you also deserve commendation for your performance. I hope that this will become routine for you, <name>, my Deathstalkers always have use of a good man."
    },
    {
      "id": "5481",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "Gordo's Task"
    },
    {
      "id": "5481",
      "field": "detail",
      "english": "Master want weeds. Us gots big hands and not good at picking. You help us and we not hurt you. Us need gloom weed. Many weeds around here and near road.\n\nWhen you have gloom weed you take to Master Holland in Brill graveyard."
    },
    {
      "id": "5481",
      "field": "objective",
      "english": "Collect 3 Gloom Weed and deliver them to Junior Apothecary Holland in the Brill graveyard."
    },
    {
      "id": "5481",
      "field": "progress",
      "english": "Where's that useless abomination? Either you have what I need or you'd best get out there and find it."
    },
    {
      "id": "5481",
      "field": "complete",
      "english": "What's this? Gloom weed?! I've no need for gloom weed! That mindless mass of flesh is out there picking daisies and convincing the Lady knows how many dupes like you into doing the same. No offense.\n\nVery well, you're here now and that's all that matters. Since I'm not going to bother to try to explain things to that abomination how about you collect what I really need... doom weed!"
    },
    {
      "id": "5482",
      "field": "title",
      "english": "Doom Weed"
    }
  ],
